devedu.deepin-configs (1.1.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Wait for the legacy keybinding daemon to apply screenshot changes before
    confirming, avoiding an intermittent false failure.
  * Resolve the persistent runtime helper when building a new controller, so
    status queries no longer report the dock drop-in as customized.

 -- eduardodaluz <eduardo.r.luz@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:05:00 -0300

devedu.deepin-configs (1.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Support both keybinding service generations for the screenshot shortcut:
    dde-shell with the long identifier and dde-session-daemon with the short
    identifier, typed GetShortcut and JSON replies.
  * Restore no longer overwrites a customized user unit when the panel
    record was removed.

 -- eduardodaluz <eduardo.r.luz@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:20:00 -0300

